            <ArticleTitle>High-dose levothyroxine for the management of bipolar affective disorder: two case reports.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>2054270417715567</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1177/2054270417715567</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In this article, we report two cases from our centre: case A has the longest recovery period and case B is one of the most complex from a diagnostic and management perspective, highlighting how treatment resistance can be overcome depending on patient response and needs.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
